        "note": "Companion formalization by the same authors, registered on Palomar as PALOMAR-2026-10-01-000011 (version 1, published 2026-10-01). This development reuses its BIC/envelope machinery (Myerson's lemma: BIC iff monotone interim allocation plus the envelope payment formula). The two formalize different theorems: revenue equivalence (equal interim allocations and equal reference-type utility force equal payments) versus optimal auction design (which allocation maximizes expected revenue).",
